WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
I’m Christopher Han, co-founder of KICE Arena. I want to create stories and music.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
This Codex-built tool turns editable prose into an interactive story.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
I visualize audio frequencies to give music another form of expression.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
I’ll finish one creative project each month and share its process with other creators.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
I’ll share what I create, so more people can create what they imagine.
